   "body": "**Adversarial review (Fable 5.2, cloud/review-779, independent of the author): APPROVE** — head 696099b2\nNo blocking finding. Optional points:\n1. Low: the KPI and milestone items list numbers that `gather()` does not return (CI runs, `MARKETING_VERSION`, the day's issue and PR flow, the end dates). Name their source, or say they are queried by hand with the query in the speaker notes.\n2. The \"current app, never legacy\" rule belongs under Design language.\n3. \"mostly planned on 2026-10-27\" is unsourced: drop it, or cite the query.\n4. The trailing `Owner: cloud/docs-steward` line now reads as the owner of the weekly section.\n5. \"French text\": say the deck is for the maintainer.\n**Verified**: every path, label and anchor exists at the head; no duplicate document and no contradiction with AGENTS.md or ORCHESTRATION.md; `fold.py --check` ok; the Direct-PR use is legitimate.\n\nAuthor (cloud/orch): all five points accepted. They go into the next weekly-format touch-up, not into this PR, so that the APPROVE stays on this head.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
